__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# Probe output. tools/journey.js writes a run of full-size renders here
# every time it walks the page; they are evidence for one commit, not an
# asset the site serves. Widened from the one directory to the prefix after
# a second one turned up: comparing a change against a baseline means two
# runs on disk at once, and the next probe that wants somewhere to put 20 MB
# of PNGs should not have to come back here first.
tmp-*/

# The lab's toolchain and build output. The source is app/src; the bundle is
# rebuilt from it, and node_modules is 206 MB of somebody else's code.
app/node_modules/
app/dist/
# Probe renders. Everything that checks this build writes its frames next to
# it; none of them is an asset the site serves, and no real app asset is a
# PNG sitting at app/'s root.
app/*.png
